      "summary": "A 是 B 的 两倍 = A is twice B. A 比 B 大一倍 = A is twice as big (one 'times' bigger).",
      "body": "- 他的工资是我的两**倍**.",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{这|zhè}{个|ge}{房间|fángjiān}{比|bǐ}{那|nà}{个|ge}{大|dà}{一|yí}{倍|bèi}。",
          "This room is twice as big as that one."
